    "body": "> Thanks, would you like to add yourself to the Acknowledgments section?\r\n\r\n@annevk been there done that _(thanks to you)_ 😄 \r\nI have been using my first name since my Mother passed over the holiday. Ra'Shaun is my middle name. Updated in 180cac7.\r\n\r\nThat said...I was going to change the previous person's acknowledgement as [it looks like something funky went on at the tail end](https://github.com/whatwg/dom/blob/master/dom.bs#L10100-L10101). However didn't feel I had right to touch someone else's acknowledgement. I crossed my fingers and attempted to blame `dom.bs` to see if I did that when I was added a while back but takes so long github says _\"taking too long to load\"_. I've always gotten this but never bought it up. I digress.\r\n\r\nShould we just leave it alone?\r\n",
